黑神话：悟空
"Black Myth:Wukong", a single-player video game, became an instant hit upon its launch. High-dimension media, online or video games, and electronic sports, which influence the global youth, have become a major field of  global ideological struggle. Games are increasingly reshaping the virtual world and expanding the geopolitical space of the real world, becoming the main representatives of virtual space geopolitics. Compared with the physical geopolitical landscape, the power struggle in the virtual geopolitical space is more disparate and asymmetric and like outer space, it is not entirely subject to the direct constraints of traditional sovereignty and international law. As such, there is a need to re-examine and attach greater importance to the strategic value of China's digital cultural industry